    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nWelcome to 81 Gleann na Rí, a beautifully presented three-bedroom duplex extending to approximately 103 sq. m., ideally situated within the highly regarded Druid Valley development. This attractive home has been lovingly maintained by its current owners, offering bright, spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The property provides a wonderful balance of comfort and practicality, with generous living space, three good-sized bedrooms and excellent storage, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families or those looking to trade up or downsize.\n\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and includes a welcoming living area, a well-appointed kitchen, three spacious bedrooms with the principal bedroom benefiting from a private ensuite, along with a convenient utility area and ample storage throughout. A large attic space provides further valuable storage, while the property enjoys a superb location close to Cabinteely and Killiney villages. The Green Luas line and N11 QBC are approximately 230m away, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin city centre and beyond. The continued development of nearby Cherrywood, with its expanding range of amenities, parks, schools and recreational facilities, further enhances the appeal of this well-positioned home.\n\nSpecial Features\n\n-Spacious three-bedroom duplex extending to approximately 103 sq. m.\n-Very well-presented throughout, with bright and generously proportioned accommodation\n-Ideally situated within the highly regarded Druid Valley development\n-Spacious and comfortable living accommodation\n-Well-appointed kitchen with excellent storage and workspace\n-Conveninte utility area providing additional practicality\n-Approximately 230m from the Green Luas line - Also close to M50, N11 and QBC\n-Conveniently located close to Cabinteely and Killiney villages, with a wide range of local amenities nearby\n-Annual Service of 1,459 per annum\n- 1 parking space plus visitor parking"
      },
